    dp[j] = max(dp[j], dp[j-w[i]] + v[i]);
}
```
✅ **正确: 正序遍历**
```cpp
for (int j = w[i]; j <= W; j++) {
    dp[j] = max(dp[j], dp[j-w[i]] + v[i]);
}
```

❌ **错误2: 转移方程用错**
```cpp
// 这是0-1背包的转移!
dp[i][j] = max(dp[i-1][j], dp[i-1][j-w[i]] + v[i]);
```
✅ **正确: 注意是 dp[i][j-w[i]]**
```cpp
